    title: "Google AI Overviews Explained: What They Mean for Contractors' Website Traffic",
    metaDescription: "Google now answers many searches with an AI summary above the regular results. What AI Overviews are, how they affect clicks for local businesses, and how to show up in them.",
    excerpt: "Google now answers many searches with an AI summary at the top of the page. Here's what that means for your traffic and how to adapt.",
