    metaDescription: "Schema markup labels your business details for search engines and AI tools. What it is, which types matter for contractors, what it can and can't do, and how to check it.",
    excerpt: "Schema markup is code that labels your business details so machines don't have to guess. Here's what contractors actually need.",
