      "If you've read anything about AI search lately, you may have come across llms.txt. Some marketers call it essential. Others say it does nothing. As usual, the truth is somewhere in between, and for most contractors it's a minor detail compared with the basics.",
      "Here's a plain explanation of what it is, what it isn't, and whether it's worth adding to your website.",
      "## What llms.txt is",
      "llms.txt is a plain text file placed at the root of a website, at an address like yoursite.com/llms.txt. It was proposed in 2024 as a simple way to give large language models, the AI systems behind tools like ChatGPT, a clean summary of a website and links to its most important pages.",
