      "### 5. Use Google Keyword Planner",
      "Google's Keyword Planner, available free inside a Google Ads account, gives rough search volumes and related ideas. The numbers are broad ranges, but they're useful for comparing options.",
      "### 6. Look at your competitors",
      "Look at the websites of contractors who show up above you. Which services have their own pages? Which questions do they answer? You're not copying them, just making sure you're not missing what homeowners expect to find.",
      "## Think local, and think Canadian",
      "Local wording matters. A few examples from the GTA:",
      "- Canadians often search 'eavestrough' as well as 'gutter'.",
